      "text": "I live in SW Indiana. I worked at GTNP one summer & also visited Yellowstone many times during that summer! I'm not going to try to describe it. I'm just going to say AWESOME!  Everyone should experience these 2 parks! They are close to each other!  Your video is fantastic!  I've been to Jackson with its Cowboy Bar & elkantler archs at the park entrances. GTNP gets its mail from Moran. Moran, at the time I was there, consisted of the post office, a very pricey general store, & 5 houses! Don't blink, you might miss it!  I love my homestate, but would also like to live in Wyoming!",
